|\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr` | Install files to `/usr` (standard system location) |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Put libraries in `/usr/lib` (not `/usr/lib64`) |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use Intel's **C compiler** (icx) |\n| `-DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=icpx`"}